1
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,426
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,866
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,940
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,586
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,026
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,946
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,920
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,066
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:56,679
Here are all the records

10
00:00:56,719 --> 00:00:57,520
of Shunfa Auto Shop,

11
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,280
from business registration to hiring.

12
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:02,119
They should cover
from two years before your parents died

13
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:03,840
until the shop closed.

14
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,599
See if there's anything useful.

15
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,640
(Wang Bingkun)
Wang Bingkun. I recognize this name.

16
00:01:07,879 --> 00:01:09,000
That's the butler's signature.

17
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:11,120
He uses this name to buy supplies

18
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,560
and keep accounts for the Lu family.

19
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,640
Looks like his ties to Lu Qiuliang

20
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:21,599
go beyond what we've uncovered.

21
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:25,080
=Quite The Girl=

22
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:25,573
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

23
00:01:25,573 --> 00:01:26,106
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

24
00:01:26,106 --> 00:01:27,440
=Episode 27=

25
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,159
Dad.

26
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:34,480
I just got word.

27
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,159
Duan Xiuming's older brother,
Duan Liqing,

28
00:01:36,159 --> 00:01:37,319
is about to arrive in Xizi City.

29
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,719
Duan Liqing?

30
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:40,640
The eldest son of the Duan family,

31
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,560
in charge of their Xiangjiang HQ?

32
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:44,239
That's right.

33
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,640
I've looked into him carefully.

34
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:53,799
He has deep roots at Dongchen.

35
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,920
Several senior shareholders

36
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,519
are firmly on his side.

37
00:01:56,879 --> 00:01:57,920
Most importantly,

38
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:01,319
Duan Xiuming really respects him

39
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:03,480
and listens to him on major matters.

40
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:08,879
Make the arrangements.

41
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:10,080
When he gets here,

42
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:11,479
pick the right moment.

43
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:13,639
I'll welcome him personally.

44
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,400
Got it.

45
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,800
Sir.

46
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,120
How may I help you?

47
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:37,199
Hello.

48
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,719
I'd like to buy this painting.

49
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:40,439
I'm sorry, sir.

50
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:41,840
The exhibitor of this painting

51
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:43,800
is displaying it, not selling it.

52
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,719
That's a shame.

53
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,919
Could you introduce me to the exhibitor?

54
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:48,719
Of course.

55
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:49,759
One moment, please.

56
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,199
Hello, sir.

57
00:02:58,319 --> 00:02:59,919
I'm the exhibitor of this show.

58
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,080
My surname is Lu.

59
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,120
And yours?

60
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,039
Hello.

61
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,960
I'm Duan Liqing.

62
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,800
It's a pleasure, Mr. Duan.

63
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,560
The staff told me

64
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:11,080
you wanted to buy this painting.

65
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:12,560
That's right.

66
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,960
Next month is my wedding anniversary.

67
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,439
The snowy mountains in this painting

68
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,319
are where I proposed to my wife.

69
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,639
I've searched for this painting
for ages.

70
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,080
I never expected

71
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,159
to find it here today.

72
00:03:22,919 --> 00:03:23,960
But, Mr. Duan,

73
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,639
the staff should have told you

74
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:27,719
it's for display only.

75
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,319
But that's all right.

76
00:03:30,639 --> 00:03:32,919
I've decided to give it to you.

77
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:33,639
Well...

78
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:34,800
I couldn't possibly accept.

79
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,960
Art has a price.

80
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:37,199
But love is priceless.

81
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,639
I can tell

82
00:03:38,759 --> 00:03:41,080
your love for your wife runs deep.

83
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,479
If this painting

84
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:44,479
can be your anniversary gift

85
00:03:44,719 --> 00:03:46,039
and stay by your side,

86
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:47,879
that would be its greatest value.

87
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:50,240
Thank you for the painting
and your kindness.

88
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:52,080
My wife and I will treasure it.

89
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:56,159
Meeting through this painting

90
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,199
must be fate.

91
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:59,280
Thanks again for your generosity.

92
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:01,120
Actually, I came to Xizi City

93
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,319
to take care of some family business.

94
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,759
Do you have relatives here, Mr. Duan?

95
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,719
If there's anything

96
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:08,199
I can do to help,

97
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,400
please don't hesitate to ask.

98
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,120
My younger brother, Duan Xiuming,

99
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,479
is building his career here.

100
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,360
I'll drop by and see him.

101
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,199
Duan Xiuming is your brother?

102
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,879
What a small world.

103
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:29,759
Mr. Lu, you know my brother?

104
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:31,199
Since you've asked...

105
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,240
It's a disgrace to my family.

106
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,120
I failed to raise her properly.

107
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,040
My useless niece, Lu Mingyu,

108
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,879
has secretly married

109
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,160
your brother, Duan Xiuming,

110
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,160
without telling either family.

111
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,199
What?

112
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,959
My niece lost her parents

113
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,639
when she was little.

114
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:53,560
As her uncle,
I failed to discipline her.

115
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,600
She's always been too wild.

116
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:57,360
She was engaged twice

117
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,879
to the Qin family's second son

118
00:04:58,879 --> 00:05:00,079
and made a public spectacle of it.

119
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,959
But neither engagement came to anything.

120
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,360
Who would've thought

121
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,079
she'd do this again with your brother...

122
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,439
Mr. Lu,

123
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,639
my family may not have
a century of history,

124
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,240
but we do have rules.

125
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:19,279
We don't just let any girl

126
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,879
marry in on a whim.

127
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:24,120
But, Mr. Duan,

128
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,680
what's done is done.

129
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:28,120
Who's going to turn back the tide?

130
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,240
It's time to step in.

131
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,560
(Shunfa Auto Shop)
This is the copy

132
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,199
(Settlement and File Transfer Form)
from the butler's resignation.

133
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:43,720
He joined the Lu family
the very next day.

134
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,079
You remember it so clearly?

135
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,399
That was the day

136
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:48,560
Lu Qiuliang brought me to his family.

137
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,360
Do you remember anything about him?

138
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,600
A little.

139
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,839
He always kept his head down.

140
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:58,879
He wore greasy work clothes,

141
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:00,240
busy in the workshop.

142
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,680
He'd mumble "Miss" when he saw me,

143
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,879
then hurry off.

144
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,680
When did he become the butler?

145
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:07,040
When I was in middle school.

146
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,040
He rose through the Lu family
so quickly.

147
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,240
His hands can't be clean.

148
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,720
He must've been involved
in my dad's car crash.

149
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:22,360
Zhan Xiang just messaged me.

150
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,879
The butler visits his mother

151
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,639
every Friday from 3 to 5 PM.

152
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,800
Now we just need to find a way

153
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,040
to get him to reveal
Lu Qiuliang's involvement.

154
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,319
Xiuming.

155
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:38,160
Mrs. Duan's back in Xiangjiang.

156
00:06:38,319 --> 00:06:39,879
Our people have received them.

157
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,000
Mom really took a liking to Mingye.

158
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,519
She'd be thrilled to know

159
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,399
we're married.

160
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,600
Then why didn't you tell her?

161
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,560
I'll find the right time.

162
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:50,480
Oh, right.

163
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,399
I need to tell my brother.

164
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:56,360
Liqing.

165
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:57,959
I'm getting married.

166
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:58,600
To...

167
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,079
Duan Liqing.

168
00:07:03,279 --> 00:07:04,519
You dare hang up on me?

169
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,920
X-Xiuming.

170
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,000
Maybe your brother's in a meeting.

171
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,839
Find out which meeting room he's in.

172
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,240
And blow it up.

173
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,160
Xiuming!

174
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:16,700
(Dongchen Group)

175
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:25,120
Liqing?

176
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,560
When did you get here?

177
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,879
Why didn't you tell me?

178
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,480
Marriage is a huge deal.

179
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,959
How could you decide on a whim?

180
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,199
Duan Xiuming,

181
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,800
do you even care about our family?

182
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:40,439
Liqing,

183
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:43,120
my marriage to her is a bit complicated.

184
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:45,439
But we're legally married now.

185
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:47,839
I wanted to tell you right away.

186
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,720
I don't care what your reasons are.

187
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,519
You got the marriage certificate

188
00:07:51,759 --> 00:07:52,720
without telling us

189
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,720
or making it public.

190
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,279
That's breaking the rules.

191
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,720
Back in Xiangjiang,

192
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:58,199
Uncle Chen said the other day

193
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,720
he wanted to set you up
with his daughter.

194
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,360
You can turn him down for me.

195
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:07,759
What was I supposed to say?

196
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,000
"Sorry,

197
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:11,120
my brother secretly married someone"?

198
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:12,959
This affects our family's reputation

199
00:08:12,959 --> 00:08:13,680
and credibility.

200
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,519
How does that look?

201
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,279
I was wrong.

202
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,800
I know I messed up.

203
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,680
Calm down, please.

204
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,319
Calm down? How?

205
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,279
Besides, what you've done

206
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,439
is unfair to your wife.

207
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,800
Look at my wife and me.

208
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,519
When I knew she was the one,

209
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,480
I told the whole family right away

210
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,199
and married her in grand style.

211
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,320
I gave her dignity

212
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,600
and a sense of security.

213
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,240
Well, I...

214
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:34,840
Mr. Duan,

215
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,279
please sign this document.

216
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,080
Who's she?

217
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,000
Your assistant, right?

218
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,200
Yes.

219
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:52,799
Perfect.

220
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,039
Let me ask you something.

221
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:55,720
Say you had a boyfriend

222
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,399
and you secretly got married

223
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,519
without his family knowing.

224
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,360
Wouldn't you be upset?

225
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,519
Wouldn't you feel disrespected?

226
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,639
From a woman's perspective,

227
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:13,480
it would feel disrespectful
and insecure.

228
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,039
See?

229
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:20,279
That's how a woman really feels.

230
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:22,559
Don't take her silence

231
00:09:22,559 --> 00:09:23,679
to mean she doesn't mind.

232
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:24,600
If she finds out

233
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,399
you treat marriage so lightly,

234
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,840
she won't just be angry.

235
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,960
She'll be heartbroken.

236
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,639
She might not even let you touch her!

237
00:09:37,013 --> 00:09:38,506
(Duan Xiuming)

238
00:09:44,879 --> 00:09:45,240
Hello?

239
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:46,600
Go ahead.

240
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,799
Is my tie loose?

241
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,679
Handle it yourself.

242
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:05,080
You can handle this.

243
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,159
What are you even here for?

244
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:14,399
No sense of security, huh?

245
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:27,279
How did you review this document?

246
00:10:27,279 --> 00:10:28,879
It's completely different
from the last version.

247
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,440
Check it again.

248
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,759
I'll be right on it.

249
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:39,799
Did you hear me?

250
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,039
Are you listening?

251
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,120
Yes, I did.

252
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,159
I'll marry her grandly and lavishly,

253
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:47,120
just like you married your wife.

254
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:47,720
How's that?

255
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:49,159
Quit grinning.

256
00:11:15,650 --> 00:11:20,180
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

257
00:11:22,770 --> 00:11:26,343
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

258
00:11:29,730 --> 00:11:34,250
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

259
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:40,410
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

260
00:11:43,050 --> 00:11:49,250
♪A love letter written in song♪

261
00:11:49,810 --> 00:11:54,503
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

262
00:11:57,130 --> 00:12:03,116
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

263
00:12:03,890 --> 00:12:09,463
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

264
00:12:10,350 --> 00:12:17,090
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

265
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:20,170
♪Close your eyes and count♪

266
00:12:20,450 --> 00:12:24,870
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

267
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:29,070
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
